! ===== 电子碰撞反应 (Electron impact reactions) =====

! Reaction 1: 电子-H2 弹性碰撞 (Elastic collision)
e- + H2 --> e- + H2
lxcat 0.0 ELASTIC.txt

! Reaction 2: 电子-H2 振动激发 (Vibrational excitation)
e- + H2 --> e- + H2
lxcat 0.516  EXCITATION2.txt

! Reaction 3: 电子-H2 电离 (Ionization)
e- + H2 --> e- + e- + H2+
lxcat 15.43 IONIZATION.txt

! Reaction 4: 电子-H2 解离电离 (Dissociative ionization)
e- + H2 --> e- + e- + H+ + H
lxcat 19.00 dissociativ.txt

! Reaction 5: 电子-H2 解离电离 (Dissociative ionization)
e- + H2 --> e- + H + H
lxcat 19.00 dissociative_EXCITATION.txt

! ===== H+ 碰撞反应 (H+ impact reactions) =====

